# i4-vtec: written by tools/scorecard --write-fullrange. Holds at throttle 0.75 every 250 rpm
# from idle (the first hold of holds-t100.scn) to below the limiter at 9400 rpm.
# Each hold is 0.5 s of settling and at least 24 whole cycles and 1 s; 0.25 s sweeps join the holds.
hold 770 0.75 4.3
sweep 770 1000 0.75 0.25
hold 1000 0.75 3.4
sweep 1000 1250 0.75 0.25
hold 1250 0.75 2.9
sweep 1250 1500 0.75 0.25
hold 1500 0.75 2.5
